OL,3,GNEWSASpecial locations are 'holy grail'
OL,4,Afor film makers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs some classic films are made and
OL,7,Fremade, location scouts face a constant
OL,8,Fchallenge to find fresh filming
OL,9,Flocations.
OL,11,FSo was the case with the 2026 version
OL,12,Fof the Jane Austen classic Sense and
OL,13,FSensibility which was previously shot
OL,14,Fin south-west England in 1995.
OL,16,F"The holy grail of location-finding is
OL,17,Fsomething new, that hasn't been seen
OL,18,Fbefore, and is very special, explains
OL,19,FEddy Pearce from location specialist
OL,20,FThe Westcountry Set.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
