OL,3,GNEWSASpecial locations are 'holy grail'
OL,4,Afor film makers
OL,5,
OL,6,FPearce said he discovered just that
OL,7,Fspecial place right on his doorstep
OL,8,Fwhen he came across Kingston Russell, a
OL,9,Fprivate home tucked away in west
OL,10,FDorset.
